Package: bnpmccr
Title: Bayesian Nonparametric Conditional Copula Regression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Anonymous", "Author", email = "anonymous@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements Bayesian nonparametric multivariate conditional copula
    regression with varying coefficients for mixed-type responses. The package
    provides functions for fitting flexible marginal regressions and
    covariate-dependent Gaussian copula mixtures using Markov chain Monte Carlo.
    It is intended to support the reproducibility of the accompanying manuscript.
